        "caption": "During a PGGMB conference, the Head of Education, Inche Idris bin Babji, regarded the year as a significant milestone for the association, which had reached its 21st year. The government announced the revision of Brunei's education policy, aligning it with the country's economic progress. Idris also emphasized the importance of the Malay language as Brunei's official language while recognizing the ongoing use of English. This reflects the government's commitment to education reform and adherence to constitutional principles.",
